60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Candidate A, Home Follow-Up, has strong evidence but poor funding. Candidate B, Perinatal, uses slack staff.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Candidate C, Day Rehab, needs space we don't have. Candidate D, Chronic Care, is complex.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Candidate B seems viable if we structure the ownership clearly to avoid the joint clinic mistake.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Candidate B aligns with the midwifery slack. Candidate A is too risky financially.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Candidate B offers a clear path with existing resources. I support it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, how would you structure the ownership for Candidate B to prevent failure?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Yumi, does the pediatric department have the capacity to join the midwifery team?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, by assigning a single lead department with a clear budget line, not a joint one.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, I believe so, given the current staffing review. It seems feasible.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,This approach respects our financial limits and staffing realities.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am convinced Candidate B is the most sustainable option given our constraints.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree. It avoids the infrastructure bottlenecks I was worried about.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I am satisfied that the structural risks are mitigated. I will vote for B.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I am happy to support a program that uses our current strengths.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,A wise choice that balances need with capability.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
